  "description": "REPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES UD HM 29 monocoque carbon frame with 12mm thru axle, BOOST 148mm, predisposition for Di2 and PLUS 2.8. The rear stay is extremely compact and reactive and allows most of the rear vibrations to be discharged onto the top tube. Its Boost conformation with 148mm wheelbase is designed to perfectly support stress, guaranteeing exceptional performance in all conditions of effort. The possibility of using wheels from 29\" up to 2.35 in section and the particularly stable and easy-to-handle front end make the ORTLES 297+ fast and smooth even on challenging surfaces. IDEAL FOR ORTLES 297+ is designed for cross country use. Fast and easy to handle, it allows you to have a high level of control even on technical trails and windy single tracks. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a quality mountain bike and are a moderately expert biker. Thanks to the easily controllable and easy-to-handle riding setting, it is suitable for those looking for a reliable trail bike for long days in the saddle, on par with our higher-end competition bikes.",
